{"id":19756,"date":"2024-08-05T13:13:21","date_gmt":"2024-08-05T13:13:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=19756"},"modified":"2025-06-10T18:47:43","modified_gmt":"2025-06-10T18:47:43","slug":"pmma-corneal-eye-protectors","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/centralindiaexport.com\/product\/pmma-corneal-eye-protectors\/","title":{"rendered":"PMMA Corneal Eye Protectors"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3>Specification Table for PMMA Corneal Eye Protectors<\/h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Specification<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Material<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Polymethyl methacrylate (PMMA)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sterility<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Supplied sterile<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Handling<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Can be handled using silicone suction plungers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Functionality<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Squeeze the suction plunger to obtain and release suction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Size Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Available in 22mm, 24mm, 26mm, and 28mm<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Customization<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Customizable colors available<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Design<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Specially designed for bilateral fit<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Application<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Protection of the cornea during ophthalmic procedures<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Durability<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>High durability and biocompatibility<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Packaging<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Individually packaged for sterility and convenience<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>PMMA Corneal Eye Protectors are high-quality, sterile devices designed to protect the cornea during ophthalmic procedures. Made from polymethyl methacrylate (PMMA), these protectors are durable and biocompatible. They can b